  m_text: 'The comments are a storm of denial, prayers, and wild conspiracies. One post catches your eye: a traffic map showing military checkpoints. <i>They are barricading the bridges out of the city.</i>


    Before you can scroll further, the little loading icon freezes. The signal drops completely. The internet is gone.'
